{"id":"841985de31202f85","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["89-df-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","[[89-df-effective-computation]]","[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7f53d84c2164d9c5\" href=\"?note=7f53d84c2164d9c5\" title=\"89-df-godel-numbering\">89-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3997bfb78544d69c\" href=\"?note=3997bfb78544d69c\" title=\"89-df-effective-computation\">89-df-effective-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8811191242063297\" href=\"?note=8811191242063297\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-semantics\">89-df-arithmetical-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是递归可枚举公理化理论。固定有限寄存器程序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_T\">\\(P_T\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ (a\\in\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in T\\}\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\ \\mathsf{Acc}(P_T,a,w))\">\\(\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ (a\\in\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in T\\}\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\ \\mathsf{Acc}(P_T,a,w))\\)</span>；这只是原公理枚举程序的半判定形式，不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}\">\\(\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}\\)</span> 取本书编码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{taut}(a)\">\\(\\mathsf{taut}(a)\\)</span> 用已定义命题骨架的有限真值表检查：只枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\">\\(\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)\\)</span> 实际出现的命题原子上的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 赋值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>每个证明行编码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a,t,d\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a,t,d\\rangle)\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span> 是公式码，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 是理由标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是理由数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LInst}\">\\(\\mathsf{LInst}\\)</span> 是下述逻辑公理实例编码函数，其未列出的输入返回 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Arith}\">\\(\\mathsf{Arith}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_f\">\\(p_f\\)</span> 采用本书原始递归图公式/最小内部证书约定，所有数值检查按下面的有限定义子句展开。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q,i,j,k,x,y,a,t,d,w\\in\\omega\">\\(q,i,j,k,x,y,a,t,d,w\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho=\\mathsf{unseq}(y)\">\\(\\rho=\\mathsf{unseq}(y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho_i\">\\(\\rho_i\\)</span> 表示第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 行的数值码。解码失败不满足任何成功检查条件；对象语言中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists y\">\\(\\exists y\\)</span> 是算术量词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Good}_T\">\\(\\mathsf{Good}_T\\)</span> 的首参数是任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，次参数属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>。对象模板的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 是互异算术变量，与同形的元自然数参数分属不同类型；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span> 中绑定变量取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\{x\\},1)_0\">\\(\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\{x\\},1)_0\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本条的数值函数表示沿用同一固定表示环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr E\">\\(\\mathscr E\\)</span>：对下式实际出现的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_f\">\\(p_f\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的元数、有限定义子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_f\">\\(\\mathcal E_f\\)</span>、先行辅助图环境 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_f\">\\(\\eta_f\\)</span> 均为已显示数值定义的展开数据，并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Adm}(f)\">\\(\\mathsf{Adm}(f)\\)</span>。这些数据不得在同一公式的不同位置更换；特别是关系名使用其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0/1\">\\(0/1\\)</span> 特征函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Adm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Adm}\\)</span>、子句满足关系与最小证书选择均取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76cab88fafa3b379\" href=\"?note=76cab88fafa3b379\" title=\"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation\">89-df-primitive-recursive-representation</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{taut}(a)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\\ a=\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall v_iA\\to A[t/v_i]\\urcorner\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall v_i(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall v_iB)\\urcorner\n\\quad(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner t=t\\urcorner\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,i,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner u\\urcorner,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner t=u\\to(A[t/v_i]\\to A[u/v_i])\\urcorner\n\\quad(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf D_L\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,i,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner u\\urcorner,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(q)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(q\\notin\\mathsf D_L),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Row}(z,a,t,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow z=\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a,t,d\\rangle)\\land a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Good}_T(\\rho,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;|\\rho|\\land\\exists a,t,d\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),i),a,t,d)\\land\\bigl(\n(t=0\\land d=0\\land\\mathsf{taut}(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=1\\land a=\\mathsf{LInst}(d))\n\\lor(t=2\\land\\mathsf{Acc}(P_T,a,d))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=3\\land\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists b,t_j,d_j,t_k,d_k\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,k\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),k),\\mathsf{imp}(b,a),t_k,d_k)])\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=4\\land\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists h,b,t_j,d_j\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,h\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land a=\\mathsf{All}(h,b)])\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|&gt;0\\land\n\\exists t,d\\ \\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{last}(y),x,t,d)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|\\ \\mathsf{Good}_T(\\mathsf{unseq}(y),i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(y,x)\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\mid\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)&amp;\\coloneqq G_{p_{\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{Check}_T}}}(y,x,\\bar1),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\exists y\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x),\\\\\n(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Proof}_T(\\bar y,\\bar x),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((y,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{pad}(y,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle\\rho_{|\\rho|-1}\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle),&amp;|\\rho|&gt;0,\\ \\rho=\\mathsf{unseq}(y),\\\\0,&amp;y=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\forall y,x,z\\in\\omega\\quad\n((y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\land(y,z)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow x=z,\\\\\n\\forall y,x,k\\in\\omega\\quad(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\Longrightarrow(\\mathsf{pad}(y,k),x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\land\\mathsf{pad}(y,k)\\ge k.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{taut}(a)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\\ a=\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall v_iA\\to A[t/v_i]\\urcorner\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall v_i(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall v_iB)\\urcorner\n\\quad(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner t=t\\urcorner\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,i,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner u\\urcorner,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&amp;\\coloneqq\\ulcorner t=u\\to(A[t/v_i]\\to A[u/v_i])\\urcorner\n\\quad(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf D_L\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,i,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner u\\urcorner,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(q)&amp;\\coloneqq0\\quad(q\\notin\\mathsf D_L),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Row}(z,a,t,d)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow z=\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a,t,d\\rangle)\\land a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Good}_T(\\rho,i)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow i&lt;|\\rho|\\land\\exists a,t,d\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),i),a,t,d)\\land\\bigl(\n(t=0\\land d=0\\land\\mathsf{taut}(a))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=1\\land a=\\mathsf{LInst}(d))\n\\lor(t=2\\land\\mathsf{Acc}(P_T,a,d))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=3\\land\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ \\exists b,t_j,d_j,t_k,d_k\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,k\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),k),\\mathsf{imp}(b,a),t_k,d_k)])\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\lor(t=4\\land\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists h,b,t_j,d_j\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,h\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land a=\\mathsf{All}(h,b)])\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|&gt;0\\land\n\\exists t,d\\ \\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{last}(y),x,t,d)\n\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|\\ \\mathsf{Good}_T(\\mathsf{unseq}(y),i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(y,x)\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\mid\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)&amp;\\coloneqq G_{p_{\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{Check}_T}}}(y,x,\\bar1),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\exists y\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x),\\\\\n(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Proof}_T(\\bar y,\\bar x),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((y,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{pad}(y,k)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle\\rho_{|\\rho|-1}\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle),&amp;|\\rho|&gt;0,\\ \\rho=\\mathsf{unseq}(y),\\\\0,&amp;y=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\forall y,x,z\\in\\omega\\quad\n((y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\land(y,z)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)&amp;\\Longrightarrow x=z,\\\\\n\\forall y,x,k\\in\\omega\\quad(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\Longrightarrow(\\mathsf{pad}(y,k),x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\land\\mathsf{pad}(y,k)\\ge k.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>数值检查关系与对象语言证明公式保持不同类型。所有理由字段都是有限数据；仅可枚举公理使用停机运行证书，不把公理成员关系当作可判定检查。数值检查是有限有界检查，按本书图表示接口取内部方程的认证实现。派生条件仍由后续定理陈述，未写入 Prov 的定义作为预设结论。重复末行提供任意大的同结论证明码，供 Solovay 阶段构造使用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"7f53d84c2164d9c5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-effective-computation","status":"resolved","id":"3997bfb78544d69c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-effective-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"8811191242063297","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-primitive-recursive-representation","status":"resolved","id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的数值函数表示沿用同一固定表示环境 $\\mathscr E$：对下式实际出现的每个 $p_f$，$f$ 的元数、有限定义子句 $\\mathcal E_f$、先行辅助图环境 $\\eta_f$ 均为已显示数值定义的展开数据，并满足 $\\mathsf{Adm}(f)$。这些数据不得在同一公式的不同位置更换；特别是关系名使用其 $0/1$ 特征函数。$\\mathsf{Adm}$、子句满足关系与最小证书选择均取 [[89-df-primitive-recursive-representation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"P_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\omega\\ (a\\in\\{\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\mid A\\in T\\}\\leftrightarrow\\exists w\\ \\mathsf{Acc}(P_T,a,w))","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\mathsf{seq},\\mathsf{unseq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{taut}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dec}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a,t,d\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{LInst}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Arith}","display":false},{"tex":"p_f","display":false},{"tex":"q,i,j,k,x,y,a,t,d,w\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho=\\mathsf{unseq}(y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Good}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\{x\\},1)_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr E","display":false},{"tex":"p_f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Adm}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"0/1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Adm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{taut}(a)&\\Longleftrightarrow \\exists A\\in\\mathsf{Taut}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}}\\ a=\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall v_iA\\to A[t/v_i]\\urcorner\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\ulcorner\\forall v_i(A\\to B)\\to(A\\to\\forall v_iB)\\urcorner\n\\quad(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\ulcorner t=t\\urcorner\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,i,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner u\\urcorner,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\rangle)\n&\\coloneqq\\ulcorner t=u\\to(A[t/v_i]\\to A[u/v_i])\\urcorner\n\\quad(t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf D_L\\coloneqq{}&\n\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle0,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle1,i,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner,\\ulcorner B\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}},v_i\\notin\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle2,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid t\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\}\\\\\n&\\cup\\{\\mathsf{seq}\\langle3,i,\\ulcorner t\\urcorner,\\ulcorner u\\urcorner,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner\\rangle\\mid i\\in\\omega,t,u\\in\\mathrm{Tm}_{\\mathrm{PA}},A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{LInst}(q)&\\coloneqq0\\quad(q\\notin\\mathsf D_L),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Row}(z,a,t,d)&\\Longleftrightarrow z=\\mathsf{seq}(\\langle a,t,d\\rangle)\\land a\\in\\mathsf{FC}_{\\mathrm{PA}},\\\\\n\\mathsf{Good}_T(\\rho,i)&\\Longleftrightarrow i<|\\rho|\\land\\exists a,t,d\\ \\bigl[\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),i),a,t,d)\\land\\bigl(\n(t=0\\land d=0\\land\\mathsf{taut}(a))\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(t=1\\land a=\\mathsf{LInst}(d))\n\\lor(t=2\\land\\mathsf{Acc}(P_T,a,d))\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(t=3\\land\\exists j,k<i\\ \\exists b,t_j,d_j,t_k,d_k\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,k\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),k),\\mathsf{imp}(b,a),t_k,d_k)])\\\\\n&\\quad\\lor(t=4\\land\\exists j<i\\ \\exists h,b,t_j,d_j\\\\\n[d=\\mathsf{seq}\\langle j,h\\rangle\\land\\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{nth}(\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho),j),b,t_j,d_j)\\land a=\\mathsf{All}(h,b)])\\bigr)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|>0\\land\n\\exists t,d\\ \\mathsf{Row}(\\mathsf{last}(y),x,t,d)\n\\land\\forall i<|\\mathsf{unseq}(y)|\\ \\mathsf{Good}_T(\\mathsf{unseq}(y),i),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prf}_T&\\coloneqq\\{(y,x)\\in\\omega\\times\\omega\\mid\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)&\\coloneqq G_{p_{\\mathbf1_{\\mathsf{Check}_T}}}(y,x,\\bar1),\\quad\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\coloneqq\\exists y\\ \\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x),\\\\\n(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T&\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Proof}_T(\\bar y,\\bar x),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}A&\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ ((y,\\ulcorner A\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\n\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{pad}(y,k)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\mathsf{seq}(\\rho\\mathbin{\\frown}\\langle\\rho_{|\\rho|-1}\\mid i<k\\rangle),&|\\rho|>0,\\ \\rho=\\mathsf{unseq}(y),\\\\0,&y=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\forall y,x,z\\in\\omega\\quad\n((y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\land(y,z)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)&\\Longrightarrow x=z,\\\\\n\\forall y,x,k\\in\\omega\\quad(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T&\\Longrightarrow(\\mathsf{pad}(y,k),x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\land\\mathsf{pad}(y,k)\\ge k.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6502,"backlinks":[{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is the one-free-variable arithmetical\nprovability formula fixed in [[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"00938a3b569dba72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is its standard one-free-variable provability\nformula from [[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"bf19f2410ce0d03b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"该记号与 [[89-df-provability-predicate]] 中作用于 Gödel 编码的\n$\\mathrm{Len}(y)$ 区分开。"},{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is the arithmetical provability formula from\n[[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"995dd9138f5c3e5a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"95d5a7c3d486f284","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ea390338eae06fff","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]] — 可证性谓词"},{"id":"2d52ad4f119b4a14","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0d2469f2990d6f49","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_T=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{PA}}$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_T=\\mathrm{Sent}_S(\\mathcal L_T)$ 为所依赖可证性接口的固定语言和句子域；$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_T$ 为递归可枚举算术理论，$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$、$\\mathrm{Sent}_T$、证明编码和数词均取同一固定环境；$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ 使用 [[89-df-provability-predicate]] 的既有接口。"},{"id":"396f9d3c403d0603","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b2b62c1bcece60ed","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"76b37345e1a3ad95","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"77b58358ab49cf8f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_T$ : 可证性谓词 (see [[89-df-provability-predicate]])"},{"id":"453434df21a27b52","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"[[89-df-provability-predicate]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]] → [[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]] → [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]] → [[89-df-provability-predicate]] → [[89-df-sigma-one-formula]] → [[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]] → [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]"}],"outgoing":["2e7227755a8473e0","7f53d84c2164d9c5","3997bfb78544d69c","76cab88fafa3b379","8811191242063297","0d71e87a2f416230"]}